    // T30 對話:(織田信長,人物Ｂ)[[大家應該都已經知道了吧！\n(今川義元)的部隊正朝著尾張這裡進軍中。]],,,
    {"cmd": "dialogue", "speaker": "Hero::lord_1_oda", "listener": "Ctx::hero_b", "textKey": "LWN_SCN_okehazama_EFF0C300_159_30", "when": "not( (Hero::MainHero.settlement) == (Settlement::tk5_city_083) )"},
    // 舞台推导：首次发言自动入场（05 纪律 6①）: Agent::template_koushin_kashin_01,
